  "factor_name": "VIX-Conditioned Residual Reversal 10D",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-residual_return_10d * clip(0.65 + 1.35 * rolling_percentile(VIX, 252d), 0.65, 2.0)",
    "description": "Reverse each asset's causal 10-session return relative to the equal-weight tradable benchmark and scale all assets by the causal 252-session VIX percentile. VIX is observation-only and is never traded. The common daily multiplier preserves cross-sectional ranks, so this factor is explicitly documented as a stress-scaled residual reversal and should undergo library-correlation audit."
  },
